Z||000017||88 Fiero||08-31-99||07:41 PM||||I was reading some import magazine and ran into a section that sells a universal supercharge that would fit in small cars. They call it the "Rotrex" because it's using the turbine of a turbo. The guy that I've talk too said the unit is as big as the '90's mustangs alternator and the price is $1,500.00 just for the unit. It gives out about 7 to 8 lbs. of boost....
